                                                "sense_id": "0ff442ce-34ef-3ec2-a6e2-dc1f5881e6e6",
                                                "text": "Particularly engaging management's attention is the expanding market for china clay, which is mined in a sector of the Cornwall peninsula between St Austell in the south and Newquay in the north."
